sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Server as NeMo Guardrails Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant InputRails as Input Rails Pipeline
    participant Models as Baked-in ML Models<br/>(MiniLM, DeBERTa, etc.)
    participant LLM as OpenAI-compatible LLM<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant OutputRails as Output Rails Pipeline
    participant ThirdParty as Third-Party SaaS<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS

    Note over Client,ThirdParty: Flow 1: Guardrailed Chat Completion

    Client->>Server: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (optional)
    Server->>InputRails: Dispatch input rails
    InputRails->>Models: Run local ML checks<br/>(jailbreak, prompt injection, PII)
    Models-->>InputRails: Check results
    opt Third-party rails configured
        InputRails->>ThirdParty: External evaluation<br/>Auth: API Key (per-provider)
        ThirdParty-->>InputRails: Evaluation result
    end
    alt Input rails PASS
        InputRails-->>Server: Approved
        Server->>LLM: Forward chat request<br/>Auth: Bearer Token / API Key
        LLM-->>Server: LLM response
        Server->>OutputRails: Dispatch output rails
        OutputRails->>Models: Run output checks<br/>(content safety, hallucination, fact-check)
        Models-->>OutputRails: Check results
        opt Third-party output rails
            OutputRails->>ThirdParty: External evaluation<br/>Auth: API Key
            ThirdParty-->>OutputRails: Evaluation result
        end
        OutputRails-->>Server: Approved response
        Server-->>Client: JSON Response<br/>(OpenAI-compatible)
    else Input rails BLOCK
        InputRails-->>Server: Blocked (policy violation)
        Server-->>Client: Blocked response
    end

    Note over Client,ThirdParty: Flow 2: Guardrail Check (Stateless)

    Client->>Server: POST /v1/checks<br/>No Auth
    Server->>InputRails: Evaluate input/output rails
    InputRails->>Models: Run ML checks
    Models-->>InputRails: Results
    opt Rails require LLM
        Server->>LLM: LLM inference<br/>Auth: Bearer Token / API Key
        LLM-->>Server: LLM response
    end
    InputRails-->>Server: Structured check results
    Server-->>Client: Check results (pass/fail per rail)
